                    <chunk name="param_input" index="3">
                      <items count="9">
                        <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">How much of the occlusion raycasting to spend.
Balanced (default): polygons whose view factor is below 5e-5 are assumed visible instead of raycast — each such polygon can shift the normalized result by less than that, and the sweep runs several times faster.
Fast: same idea at 2e-4 — quick iteration on big models.
Reference: every contribution above the 1e-5 floor is raycast (the original behavior). Use for the final run when publishing numbers.
Sky patches are always raycast at every fidelity.</item>
                        <item name="InstanceGuid" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">67ef4072-acf1-4a78-a652-afa50651cef9</item>
                        <item name="Multiple" type_name="gh_bool" type_code="1">false</item>
